WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.833
Family movie night.

2
00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.400
Then comes a scene you'd

3
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.267
rather your kids didn't see.

4
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.100
Meet VibePlayer.

5
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.200
A free media player for Windows,

6
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.200
powered by the VLC engine,

7
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.100
with a clean design you already know.

8
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.800
Mark any part you'd rather skip.

9
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.733
Type the start and end times,

10
00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:19.667
or press a key where

11
00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:22.033
it begins and where it ends.

12
00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:25.833
VibePlayer remembers it for that file and skips it,

13
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:26.967
every time.

14
00:00:26.967 --> 00:00:28.100
No editing.

15
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.833
The original file is never touched.

16
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:33.767
So movie night stays family-friendly,

17
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.367
and nobody has to dive for the remote.

18
00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:39.100
Everything else feels familiar.

19
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.367
Hold the right side of the

20
00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:42.300
video to watch at double speed,

21
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.300
and let go to snap back.

22
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.633
Scroll to seek, and change brightness,

23
00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:50.100
subtitles or audio from one tidy menu.

24
00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:53.533
It plays almost any video or audio file,

25
00:00:53.533 --> 00:00:55.000
opens from a right-click,

26
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.467
and picks up right where you left off.

27
00:00:57.733 --> 00:00:59.267
And it runs on every version

28
00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.500
of Windows from 7 to 11:

29
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.867
64-bit, 32-bit and ARM.

30
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:07.800
VibePlayer is free.

31
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.367
Download it at nomanshafiq.com/vibeplayer
